#
#   module - Regular expression engine: the public interface (libregexp.h)
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of QuickJS libregexp.h (lines 24-65): the flags, the return codes and the
#       header layout of the compiled bytecode, and the three functions the C library
#       expects from its user. Those are callbacks here, gathered in `RegExpHost`: a Luce
#       module cannot call up into the engine that imports it. The module is the port of
#       libregexp.c; the opcodes (libregexp-opcode.h) are `opcodes.lucb`.
